  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESMI, 2016-2019, School Feeding Programme</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ESMI, 2016-2019, Skolmatsprogram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen inneb&#xe4;r ett pilotprojekt vars syfte &#xe4;r att visa en modell p&#xe5; hur det nationella skolmatsprogrammet i Etiopien kan implementeras. Projektet ska bygga upp piloter i 7 skolor i en region (zone) samt bidra med kapacitetsutveckling till andra skolor och regioner s&#xe5; det kan genomf&#xf6;ra n&#xe5;got liknande p&#xe5; egen hand efter projektets slut.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims at proving an example to the GoE of how the national school feeding prgramme may be implemented.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives for the school feeding programme are as follows:
1. Implementation of nutritional guidelines
2. Support the structural system for effective execution and management of the school feeding programme
3. Strengthening technical capacity of the school feeding program implementers

Further, the objectives for the COVID-19 response are the following:
1. Ensure physical distancing in public areas to prevent the transmission of COVID-19
2. Improve behaviours around good hygiene and sanitation practices in communities to prevent the spread of COVID-19
3. Strengthening capacity of regional government to establish a model for COVID-19 prevention that can be scaled throughout Amhara region</narrative>
  </description>
